Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.20,0:19:45.12,INS/EN,,0,0,0,,Round and round, life burns on
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.57,0:20:00.70,INS/EN,,0,0,0,,Even the pain deep in my heart becomes nourishment
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.32,0:20:08.65,INS/EN,,0,0,0,,If the sinking sun is smiling
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.72,0:20:11.09,INS/EN,,0,0,0,,(at you)
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.11,0:20:15.61,INS/EN,,0,0,0,,Then I'll smile better than anyone else
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.42,0:20:19.59,INS/EN,,0,0,0,,(thinking of you)
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.81,0:20:23.80,INS/EN,,0,0,0,,I may no longer know how to cry
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.07,0:20:26.12,INS/EN,,0,0,0,,(But I've decided)
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.45,0:20:27.51,INS/EN,,0,0,0,,That on this stage, in the place I've been given
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.51,0:20:36.73,INS/EN,,0,0,0,,I will bloom and scatter
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.56,0:20:51.04,INS/EN,,0,0,0,,Blaze up, flame of life
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.32,0:20:56.32,INS/EN,,0,0,0,,Bring an end to this night
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.32,0:20:59.66,INS/EN,,0,0,0,,Let's fill it with color
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.05,0:21:08.62,INS/EN,,0,0,0,,Hiding our wishes in the moon, I'll dance through the present
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.83,0:21:22.99,INS/EN,,0,0,0,,Toward a sky I've never seen, until the light reaches it—
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.39,0:21:30.97,INS/EN,,0,0,0,,Yes, without hesitation
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.38,0:21:19.66,INS/EN,,0,0,0,,(Some lives cannot survive the winter)
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.09,0:21:23.37,INS/EN,,0,0,0,,(But even they become blessings, turning into hope)
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.95,0:21:27.33,INS/EN,,0,0,0,,(So smile, I'm okay)
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.75,0:21:31.21,INS/EN,,0,0,0,,(Even if I burn out, there's something I can protect)
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.98,0:21:34.87,INS/EN,,0,0,0,,Come now, a nameless dawn awaits
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.87,0:21:39.47,INS/EN,,0,0,0,,Let it shine a new path forward
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.84,0:21:48.44,INS/EN,,0,0,0,,Until the day you, who tremble and weep, can smile again
